<div class="flex justify-between items-start mb-16">
<h4 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-primary group-hover:text-surface-tint transition-colors">Project Omega</h4>
<span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline group-hover:text-primary transition-colors transform group-hover:translate-x-1 group-hover:-translate-y-1">arrow_outward</span>
</div>
<p class="font-body-md text-body-md text-secondary mb-8">
            An automated infrastructure provisioning tool built for massive scale, standardizing infrastructure-as-code deployments across hundreds of development teams.
