            </p>
</div>
</div>
<!-- Item 2 -->
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-gutter py-8 md:py-12 border border-transparent hover:border-outline-variant/20 hover:bg-surface hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-500 ease-out -mx-4 px-4 rounded-2xl hover:-translate-y-1 hover:scale-[1.02] cursor-pointer group">
